    [40260] = "Bloodbound Horror: while downstairs after his frontal, each player steps on a slime at the room's edges and stays alive until everyone is slimed; then stack to clear it, and kill the Volatile Ooze that spawns. Needs at least 10 players.",
    [40261] = "Ulgrax: keep the Spider Silk Grub (back right as you enter) alive the whole fight. Click it at the start, pull the boss away from it, and herd it out of danger; it can't be healed.",
