    [40263] = "Broodtwister Ovi'nax: bring the orange egg from outside the room into the fight and have it hit by two Experimental Dosage circles; everyone /love the Disheartened Worm that hatches, then kill the boss. Needs 10 or more players.",
    [40264] = "Nexus-Princess Ky'veza: read the burning diary in the first brazier on the left to start the fight with Kill Streak, then keep it up by having someone die about every 40 seconds (stepping into a rift works).",
