    [40539] = "During the Saturday Hallowfall Fishing Derby (Captain Oathmyt in Mereldar), catch every listed fish while the Derby buff lasts. Progress carries over from week to week. Each fish comes from particular pool types in Khaz Algar, so fish pools rather than open water.",
