    [40632] = "Enter the spider cave under the City of Threads, climb the wall with the three small spiders and drop through the hole into the void pond room, then read the book in the ritual circle. Four copies of you scatter; find them in order (Rock Bottom Inn, Faerin's Advance, Wildcamp Or'lay, the Weaver's Lair). A whisper tells you when the next one is near; /target Another You helps.",
