    [40630] = "During the Ringing Deeps ore world quest, spend your ore on the contraptions (springboards, air defences, smoke screen) instead of handing it in. A repaired contraption can't take more ore for two hours.",
    [40662] = "Talk to the keeper in Gundargaz to enter Awakening the Machine and survive all 20 waves; wave 20 is the Awakened Phalanx. You can rest between every five waves. Kill channelling enemies first and stand in the green puddles medbots drop to heal.",
    [40731] = "Kill Overworked Cooks in the Deepforge area of the Ringing Deeps; they drop frying pans. Use a pan to hit enemies (or your own target dummy toy) 10 times.",
    [40729] = "Talk to Rytr Paller at Dunelle's Kindness in Hallowfall and beat him at Light's Gambit on the hardest formation. Kill his cleric first, then move your pieces behind his castle and keep attacking it from there.",
    [40732] = "Get killed by a delve nemesis (Zekvir). He can also appear in normal delves; dying to him in his own delve counts too.",
    [40789] = "Every cosmetic for the Delver's Dirigible, bought from the delve vendors in Dornogal with delve currencies. Some came from earlier seasons, so check which are still sold.",
