    [40447] = "Every War Within delve on Tier 4 or higher without running out of lives. Pick each delve on a day its story is an easy one.",
    [40449] = "Every War Within delve on Tier 11 without running out of lives. Story choice matters a lot: check the delve's story on the tier menu and skip the hard days.",
